<title>POLAND: Lubawa plans 2-for-1 share split.</title>
<headline>Lubawa plans 2-for-1 share split.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shareholders of the Polish industrial garment maker Lubawa will vote on August 26 on a planned share split of each share into two shares, the company said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>After the split the nominal value of one share will be two zlotys per share.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
